     <h1 style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 240.8%;margin-bottom: 16.5pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 17pt;text-align: center;">
</h1><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（一）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>主  考</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">琛</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;">     <strong> </strong><strong>副主考</strong><strong>：</strong>蒋  明（分管考务）   <span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><span style="margin: 0 0 0 0.29in;padding: 0 0 0 0;"></span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙洪亮（分管视频监控与保密）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 1.17in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">俞建种</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分管听力广播监听</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）    </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王月琴（到阳明中学领队）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（二）考务组：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（电话：853382</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>33</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.16in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1．</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考务负责人</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">周文龙</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.16in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2．</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>考务用品</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>准备：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汪陈帅</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、张帆</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.16in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3．试场布置验收</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.16in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>   </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>负责人：</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">林萍华</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.49in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>家贤</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>楼验收：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聂云（5楼）、王瑾（4楼）、马海幔（3楼）、诸佳英（2和1楼）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>建功楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>验收：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">      </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">章晓菁（5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）、单兴妹（4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）、王青（3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）、任方芳（2楼）、沈旖楠（1楼）</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 1.34in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -1.04in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>  </strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>主要职责：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（1）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">检查各班是否</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要求布置好试场，门贴、桌贴位置是否正确</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">特别注意课桌间距是否到80*80</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课桌</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">椅</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">是否干净</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">墙面文字覆盖</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">物</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">是否牢固</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，软板帘子是否拉下，讲台下电源是否关闭、电脑是否转向窗口，教室地面是否干净，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">A、B座位与考务手册中的座位排列表是否一致</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">； </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教室内柜子是否关严，没有门的柜子是否清理干净，挂钟是否拿掉；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>3</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>）</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">检查所负责楼层走廊课桌排列是否整齐。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 1.47in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -1.27in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>4．</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>试卷验收组</strong></span><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（具体场次以考务手册为准）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.39in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明、孙洪亮、俞建种、林萍华、陈锋、沈祥土、刘夏进、刘明玉、余栋</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">材</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、朱水军、</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.39in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.00in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">何隽豪、金笛</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>验卷人员请在考试结束前10分钟到考务组，注意学考选考时间，验卷时注意以下要点：</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.50in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（1）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">试卷、答题卡有没有缺少</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.20in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>（2）</strong></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">准考证号 、姓名是否漏写，学生姓名是否与条形码上一致，缺考标记是否漏涂、是否</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">座位号</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">从小号到大号排列</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-s